<title>CHINA: China March soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China March soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of soybean, soymeal and soyoil as reported in official customs figures (percentage change for January-March 1997 compared with the same period last year):</p>
<p>		    MARCH	  JAN-MARCH IMPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	253,034	     999,580		 N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	 100,781	     303,437		  - 22</p>
<p> Soymeal	371,219	   1,072,821		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		    MARCH	  JAN-MARCH EXPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	 39,190		64,602		 N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	   1,959		 2,600		  + 956</p>
<p> Soymeal	    709		 2,069		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
